  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot Project - Voces de Ciudadan&#xfffd;a</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase political participation in two schools in Santiago del Estero. It is structured into five phases. Preemptively, students from both localities have chosen the overarching topic for the project period. The project carries the students through a process from capacity building workshops to the development of their own project idea. Students will advocate their project to their peers, resulting in a democratic election held at both schools. Here students vote for the project they believe will benefit their school or community the most. The chosen idea will be implemented in the final phase of the pilot project. The project builds on insights into the student&#xfffd;s needs empowering them to contribute to create change.</narrative>
  </description>
